<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><h1>Notification Settings</h1><p>Choose the messages your customers receive. Email uses SMTP (Gmail App Password or another SMTP provider); WhatsApp uses an approved Meta Business template. Provider credentials stay in environment variables.</p><p>SMTP configuration: <%= providerReady.email?"present (connection not verified)":"incomplete" %>. WhatsApp configuration: <%= providerReady.whatsapp?"present (provider not verified)":"incomplete" %>.</p><form method="post" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><% Object.entries(labels).forEach(([key,label])=>{ %><label><span><input type="checkbox" name="<%= key %>" <%= (settings[key]===undefined?key.startsWith('event_'):settings[key])?'checked':'' %>> <%= label %></span></label><% }) %><div class="studio-wide"><button class="fashion-button">Save Notification Settings</button></div></form><p>Disabled events are recorded as skipped and are not sent later automatically. Customer WhatsApp numbers must include the country code. Enable messaging only for customers who have agreed to receive your service updates.</p><p><a href="/admin/notifications">View notification log and retries</a></p></main></body></html>
